{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05361","headline":"送考功武员外学士使嵩山置舍利塔歌 · 徐坚","name":"送考功武员外学士使嵩山置舍利塔歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伊川别骑，灞岸分筵。\n对三春之花月，览千里之风烟。\n望青山兮分地，见白云兮在天。\n寄愁心於樽酒，怆离绪於清弦。\n共握手而相顾，各衔凄而黯然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05361.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05361","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}